        "summary": "Pantheon dashes to a target, damaging and stunning them.",
        "bodyHtml": "Pantheon leaps on his target, <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Stunning</span> for 1 second and dealing <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(6/6.5/7/7.5/8% + (0.4% per 100 bonus Health) + (1.5% per 100 Ability Power)) max Health physical damage</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Mortal Will Bonus:</span> Pantheon's next Attack strikes 3 times, dealing a total of <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">? physical damage</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Deals a minimum of 60 and a maximum of 150 damage to Minions and Monsters.</span>",
