        "name": "Aegis Assault",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Pantheon sets his shield, becoming invulnerable to damage from the front and striking repeatedly with his spear.",
        "bodyHtml": "Pantheon braces his shield and engages enemies in a chosen direction for 1.5 seconds, becoming immune to non-tower damage from that direction and dealing <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(100% Attack Damage) physical damage</span> over the duration. After channeling Pantheon slams with his shield, dealing <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(55/105/155/205/255 + (150% bonus Attack Damage)) physical damage</span>.<br /><br /><span style=\"color: #EDDA74\">Mortal Will Bonus:</span> When Pantheon slams his shield he gains <span class=\"text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400\">(2.5% bonus Health) Armor</span> and <span>(2.5% bonus Health) Magic Resist</span> for 4 seconds, and <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">60% Move Speed</span> for 1.5 seconds. <br /><br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\"><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-300\">Recast</span> to end early (Pantheon still slams with his shield as the last hit). <br />Damage to minions is reduced by 50%.</span>",
