        "maxRank": 3,
        "summary": "Pantheon composes himself and then leaps into the air, landing at a chosen location as a comet.",
        "bodyHtml": "<span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-500 italic\">Passive:</span> Pantheon gains 10/20/30% Armor Penetration.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-semibold\">Active:</span> Pantheon gathers his strength to leap high into the air. He throws his spear from above which in a small area deals <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(70/100/130 + (115% bonus Attack Damage) + (50% Ability Power)) physical damage</span> and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slows</span> by 50% for 2 seconds. <br /><br />Pantheon then crashes down as a meteor at the target area. Deals up to <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(300/500/700 + (100% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> to enemies in a line (decreased by up to 50% at the edges of the area).<br /><br />This Ability instantly readies <span style=\"color: #EDDA74\">Mortal Will</span>.",
